<section>
<h2>Caveats</h2>
<ul>
<li>Teaching and training use: values are as Wikipedia lists them, including its disagreements. Rows where the stated span does not equal highest minus lowest are tagged "span mismatch".</li>
<li>Rainfall is a national average, not the wettest place in a country.</li>
<li>Places in the Wikipedia table without an ISO code (Clipperton Island, Bir Tawil, Spratly Islands, Ashmore and Cartier Islands, Coral Sea Islands) are left out of the dashboard and games. Kosovo is included in the games.</li>
<li>Wikipedia is edited by volunteers and is not an authoritative source for official records.</li>
</ul>
</section>
